{"id":"n26724-2-8","stage":3,"title":"웬만하다 · 一般","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26724-2-8-1","ko":"지수는 다음 주에 해외여행 간대.","zh":"智秀下周要去国外旅行呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주에","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해외여행","meaning":"海外旅行，境外游","explanation":"해외여행：海外旅行，境外游","readings":[{"term":"해외여행","audio":"/audio/f6c86ac307762c16c445.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72474","senseId":"1","lemma":"해외여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"간대.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄴ대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"周，星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"46811","definition":"从周一至周日七天为一周期计算的时间单位。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"f6c86ac307762c16","term":"해외여행","zh":"海外旅行，境外游","audio":"/audio/f6c86ac307762c16c445.mp3","entryId":"72474","definition":"去国外旅行；或指这种旅行。","pronunciation":["해ː외여행","해ː웨여행"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/11f0afc8079b12e56991.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26724-2-8-2","ko":"형편이 웬만한가 보네, 난 해외는커녕 국내 여행도 못 가는데.","zh":"看来条件还不错啊，我连国内旅行都去不了，更别提出国了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"형편이","meaning":"境况，生活状况，生活情况","explanation":"형편：境况，生活状况，生活情况；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"형편","audio":"/audio/fe4c5d364acf7ca442f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86389","senseId":"2","lemma":"형편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"웬만한가","meaning":"一般，还好","explanation":"웬만하다：一般，还好；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"웬만하다","audio":"/audio/bbf802a2fa5f3b5e7260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26724","senseId":"2","lemma":"웬만하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보네,","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해외는커녕","meaning":"海外，国外","explanation":"해외：海外，国外；는커녕：表示“别说……，连……都……”。","readings":[{"term":"해외","audio":"/audio/82862092ebbd4ef94342.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62481","senseId":"1","lemma":"해외","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"국내","meaning":"国内","explanation":"국내：国内","readings":[{"term":"국내","audio":"/audio/1583262fcc969a07bcc9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60099","senseId":"1","lemma":"국내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여행도","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가는데.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fe4c5d364acf7ca4","term":"형편","zh":"境况，生活状况，生活情况","audio":"/audio/fe4c5d364acf7ca442f2.mp3","entryId":"86389","definition":"生活的状态或处境。","pronunciation":["형편"]},{"id":"bbf802a2fa5f3b5e","term":"웬만하다","zh":"一般，还好","audio":"/audio/bbf802a2fa5f3b5e7260.mp3","entryId":"26724","definition":"接近普通或其上。","pronunciation":["웬ː만하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"82862092ebbd4ef9","term":"해외","zh":"海外，国外","audio":"/audio/82862092ebbd4ef94342.mp3","entryId":"62481","definition":"不是自己国家，别的国家。","pronunciation":["해ː외","해ː웨"]},{"id":"1583262fcc969a07","term":"국내","zh":"国内","audio":"/audio/1583262fcc969a07bcc9.mp3","entryId":"60099","definition":"国家内部。","pronunciation":["궁내"]},{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7d3c0b1f9b95e1135e0d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.737,"source"